    "explanation":  "```js\nfunction add() {\n  const _args = [...arguments];\n  function fn() {\n    _args.push(...arguments);\n    return fn;\n  }\n  fn.toString = function() {\n    return _args.reduce((sum, cur) =\u003e sum + cur);\n  }\n  return fn;\n}\n```",
